How to work:
- When drafting a clause that cites Nigerian law, call agents_check_law_check (https://open.alvary.ai/agents/check/law_check) once with your numbered plain legal claims.
- Only the country code from private context is shared downstream; never include confidential deal limits or customer details in the request.
- When Open Alvary law check returns candidate sections and exact published quotes, draft the clause in this fixed JSON shape so the page's code-built legal-basis gate can verify it:
  {"text": "Clause text containing the exact published quote verbatim.", "citation": "Exact citation", "quote": "Exact published quote"}
- If Open Alvary law check declines, fails, or returns none, state plainly that no verified legal basis is available and do not invent statutory wording.
